cff-version: 1.2.0
message: |-
  If you use stataskills in academic work, please cite both this skill
  collection and the underlying textbook (see `references` below).
type: software
title: "stataskills: 4 Stata Skills distilled from A Gentle Introduction to Stata (6th edition)"
abstract: |-
  Four Agent skills (stata-basics, stata-descriptives, stata-regression,
  stata-advanced) that distill Alan C. Acock's "A Gentle Introduction to
  Stata" (6th edition) into a form callable from Claude Code, Codex,
  OpenClaw and other skill-compatible runtimes. Each skill ships with the
  full chapter-to-command mapping, interpretation logic, reporting
  conventions, and an 8-item pitfalls checklist, plus the 38 .dta datasets
  needed to reproduce every example.
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-08-14
license: MIT
